# Pairs with RestoreAllOrNothing. Compensation moves the alias onto the shadow
# instead of leaving the pre-restore tree serving.
MODULE: RestoreAllOrNothingAbortSwapsToShadow
TARGET: RestoreAllOrNothing
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an aborting participant swaps to its shadow rather than discarding it
PERTURBS: Abort

--- FIND
    /\ vote' = [vote EXCEPT ![c] = "comp"]
    /\ data' = [data EXCEPT ![c]["new"] = {}]
    /\ log' = [log EXCEPT ![c]["new"] = {}]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<alias, bound, sent, shipOn, recvOn, rphase, pre, post>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ vote' = [vote EXCEPT ![c] = "comp"]
    \* MUTATION: the shadow is swapped in, not collected.
    /\ alias' = [alias EXCEPT ![c] = "new"]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<data, log, bound, sent, shipOn, recvOn, rphase, pre, post>>
--- END
